  "audio": "Reused unmodified vanilla assets in new5/audio.gd and mc16_sound_bank.gd. Existing provenance: MC16_NATIVE_FEEDBACK_ASSETS.json and existing Minecraft audio manifests.",
  "presentation": "Copper sword PNG and all four copper-block PNGs are byte-identical upstream files. Runtime shader blends original copper-block oxidation pigments into the original sword metal pixels, preserving its alpha/bevel and wooden grip. Rusting swords are custom character gameplay, not an assertion that vanilla provides oxidized sword items. Lightning and enchantment effects reuse trident_lightning.gd and trident_charge_visual.gd.",
